# ** 5. A commodity no longer held is not fetched, nor is one never held in
# an asset or liability account.
<
2026-10-05 buy
    assets:broker      10 VEQT.TO @ $45
    assets:cash      $-450

2026-10-20 sell
    assets:broker     -10 VEQT.TO @ $47
    assets:cash        $470

2026-10-21 buy
    assets:broker       5 XEQT.TO @ $30
    assets:cash      $-150

2026-10-22 points
    expenses:shopping     100 PTS
    revenues:rewards     -100 PTS

$ D=$(mktemp -d) && cd $D && touch new.j && hledger -f - import --get --dry-run --today 2026-11-12 new.j 2>&1; s=$?; cd /; rm -rf $D; exit $s
no ./data/getdata script, skipping data fetch
would run: yahoo XEQT.TO or XEQT.TO-USD 2026-10-14..2026-11-11 >./prices/XEQT.TO.prices
